 plugins/disk-cleanup/disk_cleanup.py      | 126 ++++++++++++++--------
 tests/plugins/test_disk_cleanup_plugin.py |  97 +++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 190 insertions(+), 43 deletions(-)

